{{!
    @template block_compass/group

    One category group of tier 3: a disclosure with the count and the rows.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="group" with data-group-id on the root.
    * data-region="group-count" on the visible "N courses" label, rewritten by the JS on every filter change.
    * data-region="rows" wrapping the rows, each inside a data-region="row-item" listitem wrapper (see
      block_compass/row); the JS stamps data-group-id on the wrapper and moves it between this group
      and the flat list of block_compass/explore when the sort changes.
    * data-action="showmore" on the "Show more" button under the rows. It ships hidden: in paged mode
      (ADR-004) the JS reveals it while the group has more rows on the server than it holds, and reads
      "Loading…" while a page is in flight; in full mode it stays hidden.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id, name, count - the group.
    * open - whether the disclosure starts open.
    * courses - list of rows, see block_compass/row (empty in paged mode: rows are fetched on first open).
    * uniqid - a unique id (the js helper provides it).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": 3, "name": "Police", "count": 2, "open": true,
        "courses": [
            {"id": 7, "name": "Approach tactics", "opened": 1725000000, "new": false, "fav": true, "courseurl": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=7"},
            {"id": 9, "name": "Community policing", "opened": null, "new": true, "fav": false, "courseurl": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=9"}
        ]
    }
}}
<details class="compass-group" id="compass-group-{{id}}-{{uniqid}}" data-region="group" data-group-id="{{id}}"{{#open}} open{{/open}}>
    <summary class="compass-group-summary d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
        <span class="compass-group-name fw-bold">{{name}}</span>
        <span class="compass-group-count small text-muted" data-region="group-count">{{#str}}coursesingroup, block_compass, {{count}}{{/str}}</span>
    </summary>
    <div class="compass-rows" data-region="rows" role="list">
        {{#courses}}
        <div class="compass-rows-item" role="listitem" data-region="row-item">
            {{> block_compass/row }}
        </div>
        {{/courses}}
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm compass-showmore" data-action="showmore" hidden>{{#str}}showmore, block_compass{{/str}}</button>
</details>
